																		<r3d:remarks>Pseudobase is covered by Thomson Reuters Data Citation Index. Using the simple structure of PseudoBase, Texas university designed a new shell around the data of PseudoBase for improved access. It provides more extensive and improved searching capabilities and more and better presentations for viewing the knotted RNA&#039;s. PseudoBase++ is reached at http://pseudobaseplusplus.utep.edu.</r3d:remarks>
